# Line endings: LF everywhere in the repository, whatever the contributor's OS. Golden files, shell
# scripts and embedded UI assets are compared byte-for-byte, so CRLF from a Windows checkout breaks them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# GitHub language statistics and diffs: vendored/generated files are not "the code".
testing/schema/*.json linguist-vendored
internal/cdxschema/schemas/*.json linguist-vendored
web/static/fonts/** linguist-vendored
internal/tlsprobe/registry/*_gen.go linguist-generated
